# Cursor Rules for {{ cookiecutter.project_name }}

This project uses uv/Ruff/{{ cookiecutter.type_checker }}/pytest stack

## Environment

- Use **uv** for all dependency management
- Install: `uv sync`
- Run commands: `uv run <command>`
- Add dependency: `uv add <package>` (or `uv add --dev <package>`)

## Quality Gate (run before commits)

```bash
uv run ruff format .
uv run ruff check . --fix
uv run {{ cookiecutter.type_checker }}{% if cookiecutter.type_checker in ["ty", "pyrefly"] %} check{% endif %}

uv run pytest
{%- if cookiecutter.deptry %}
uv run deptry {% if cookiecutter.layout == "src" %}src{% else %}.{% endif %}

{%- endif %}
```

Or: `make check && make test`
{% if cookiecutter.agent_profile == "full" %}

## Code Conventions

- Line length: 120 characters
- Always use `from __future__ import annotations`
- Full type hints on all functions
- Google/NumPy style docstrings for public APIs
- Prefer dataclasses/Pydantic over raw dicts
- Use `list[T]`, `dict[K, V]` over `List[T]`, `Dict[K, V]`
- Use `| None` over `Optional[T]`

## Project Structure

```tree
{% if cookiecutter.layout == "src" %}src/{% endif %}{{ cookiecutter.project_slug }}/    # Main package
tests/              # Test files (mirror source structure)
{%- if cookiecutter.mkdocs %}
docs/               # MkDocs documentation
{%- endif %}
```

## Testing

- Mirror source structure in tests/
- Name tests: `test_<function>_<scenario>_<expected>`
- Use pytest fixtures in conftest.py
- Run single test: `uv run pytest tests/test_file.py::test_name -v`
{% endif %}

## PR Guidelines

- Small, focused PRs
- Include/update tests
{%- if cookiecutter.mkdocs %}
- Update docs for API changes
{%- endif %}
{%- if cookiecutter.changelog %}
- Add an entry under `## [Unreleased]` in `CHANGELOG.md` for user-facing changes, using the Keep a Changelog categories (Added, Changed, Deprecated, Removed, Fixed, Security)
{%- if cookiecutter.agent_profile == "full" %}; create the category heading if missing, e.g. `### Fixed` then `- Handle empty input in load_config.`{% endif %}
{%- endif %}
- Conventional Commits: feat:, fix:, docs:, refactor:, test:, chore:
